            "review_title": "Review at Hong Ngoc Dynastie restaurant",
            "review_text": "TSRLondon\nLondon, United Kingdom73 contributions\n0\nSuperb - some of the best food I've eaten in Vietnam!\nMay 2017 • Business\nWhat a transformation in a year - this hotel has completely restyled its ground floor since last year and now sports a stylish restaurant with a great atmosphere, stylish decor with B&W photos of Hanoi adorning the walls. \nThe food was a real treat - authentic dishes, fresh and tasty with generous portions of seafood, pork, beef and chicken, as well as some interesting local dishes, flavoursome pho and several types of spring rolls and delicious salads full of herbs and spices. A good selection of cocktails, wine and beer was available. Our party so enjoyed our meal we returned three times in our week! \nThe restaurant is conveniently located in the Old Quarter and easy walking distance from the fascinating shopping streets in the area. \nI stayed at the hotel in which this restaurant is located last year and it too can be highly recommended as an excellent value for money mid-range hotel. \nEnjoy!\nRead more\nWritten May 19, 2017",
