            "review_title": "Review at Hong Ngoc Dynastie restaurant",
            "review_text": "Judith D\n37 contributions\n0\nWhat an absolute gem\nAug 2016\nCame across this hotel by accident when looking for somewhere to eat on our last night in Hanoi. Wish we'd found it three nights earlier! Oh wow! what service, food and atmosphere. They love westerners, the menu is varied and caters for westerners and the service was fantastic. \nI had the chicken burger and after two weeks of rice I could have eaten two of them. Absolutely delicious! Hubby had duck and rice and said it was fantastic. We had a serve of spring rolls and a beer each and the whole meal came to $18 AUD. We are going back to Hanoi and this will be the first place we eat! Thank you so much Dynastie...you made our night!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 29, 2016",
